  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Solar Power for 10 health care centres  In Uganda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Currently, 70% of public health centres in rural communities in Uganda do not have access to electricity of which 3 out of every 4 health centres are without access to reliable power,1 in 4 health facilities in rural communities are without access to any power at all. This Project will provide health care facilities with installation of 1200 W solar panels, 20 kWh batteries of powered lighting system for 10 health centres in the vulnerable communities to handle emergency health situations,</narrative>
  </description>
